{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["And he said, <b>For how shall I go up to my father</b> — to inform him that he would choose to be an eternal slave rather than go up to his father without the youth, for he would not be able to look upon his misfortune, since he would weep constantly and lament over him all the day. And he mentioned this so that he would not suspect him of practicing deception, since he knew how to flee better than the youth."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:44:53.472558298Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}